  "reply": "根据附件PDF（USCOURTS-laed-2_23-cv-02060-0.pdf）第8页的法院论述，路易斯安那州法律明确规定：**剩余市场保险人（surplus lines insurers）无需经保险部（Department of Insurance）批准。**\n\n原文直接陈述：\n> \"Surplus lines insurers, such as Defendant, are not subject to approval by the Department of Insurance.\"\n\n该论述引用的法律依据为《路易斯安那州修订法典》第22:868(D)条（La. R.S. §22:868(D)）。",
